<main id="main">
<section class="hero" id="top" aria-labelledby="hero-title">
 <div class="hero-art scene" data-scene="orbital" aria-hidden="true">
  <svg class="fallback" viewBox="0 0 1000 800"><defs><radialGradient id="fallbackGlow"><stop stop-color="#467cac" stop-opacity=".35"/><stop offset="1" stop-color="#0b1622" stop-opacity="0"/></radialGradient><linearGradient id="fallbackCrystal"><stop stop-color="#d0eaff" stop-opacity=".65"/><stop offset="1" stop-color="#1c3d5e" stop-opacity=".1"/></linearGradient></defs><circle cx="570" cy="380" r="340" fill="url(#fallbackGlow)"/><g fill="none" stroke="#84accc" opacity=".45" transform="rotate(-32 570 380)"><ellipse cx="570" cy="380" rx="310" ry="160"/><ellipse cx="570" cy="380" rx="320" ry="170"/><ellipse cx="570" cy="380" rx="295" ry="150"/><ellipse cx="570" cy="380" rx="280" ry="145"/></g><path d="m570 225 90 145-90 185-85-185Z" fill="url(#fallbackCrystal)" stroke="#b4d5f0"/><path d="m570 225-30 145 30 185 35-185ZM485 370h175" fill="none" stroke="#a6cdeb"/></svg>
  <canvas></canvas><span class="art-caption a">An encoded center.<br>A different orbit.</span><span class="art-caption b">Bounded work.<br>Explicit execution.</span><span class="art-caption c">Native by design / ShardLoom</span>
 </div>
 <div class="wrap hero-content"><p class="eyebrow"><b>ShardLoom</b> / Vortex-native compute</p><h1 id="hero-title">MAKE<span class="luminous">LESS WORK.</span></h1><p class="copy">A compute engine designed around the work that never needs to happen.</p><div class="actions"><a class="btn primary" href="#engine">Explore the engine <span class="arrow">↓</span></a><a class="btn" href="https://github.com/depsilon/shardloom" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">View on GitHub <span class="arrow">↗</span></a></div><div class="hero-specs"><div><strong>Vortex-native</strong><span>ONE NATIVE MIDDLE</span></div><div><strong>Encoded-first</strong><span>WORK WITH THE DATA</span></div><div><strong>No fallback</strong><span>NO HIDDEN ENGINE</span></div></div></div>
 <div class="hero-footer"><a class="scroll-cue" href="#engine"><svg viewBox="0 0 16 28" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M8 1v22m-5-5 5 6 5-6" stroke="#a6c2d8" fill="none"/></svg>Scroll to unfold the engine</a><span class="edition"><i class="spark"></i> Vortex-native execution</span></div>
</section>
<section class="scroll-track section-anchor" id="engine" aria-labelledby="avoid-title">
 <div class="sticky-stage wrap">
  <div class="story-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">01 / Work avoidance</p><h2 id="avoid-title">The fastest work<br>is work you <span class="soft">never do.</span></h2></div><div class="story-side"><p class="index">FROM POSSIBILITY<br>TO NECESSITY</p><p class="small">Scroll through the route.<br>Watch the work disappear.</p></div></div>
  <div class="avoid-art scene" data-scene="avoid" aria-hidden="true"><svg class="fallback" viewBox="0 0 1200 320"><g stroke="#7599b8" fill="none" opacity=".5"><path d="M50 40Q550 20 1120 160M50 80Q550 40 1120 160M50 120Q550 90 1120 160M50 180Q550 180 1120 160M50 230Q550 260 1120 160M50 280Q550 310 1120 160"/><path d="M280 40v240m240-240v240m240-240v240m240-240v240" opacity=".4"/></g></svg><canvas></canvas><span class="art-caption">Only what the<br>route requires.</span></div>
  <div class="story-bottom"><div class="stage-tabs" aria-label="Explore the execution priorities"><button type="button" class="stage-tab" data-stage="0" aria-label="Show metadata stage" aria-pressed="true"><span>01</span><strong>Metadata</strong></button><button type="button" class="stage-tab" data-stage="1" aria-label="Show prune stage" aria-pressed="false"><span>02</span><strong>Prune</strong></button><button type="button" class="stage-tab" data-stage="2" aria-label="Show encoded stage" aria-pressed="false"><span>03</span><strong>Encoded</strong></button><button type="button" class="stage-tab" data-stage="3" aria-label="Show partial decode stage" aria-pressed="false"><span>04</span><strong>Partial decode</strong></button><button type="button" class="stage-tab" data-stage="4" aria-label="Show materialize stage" aria-pressed="false"><span>05</span><strong>Materialize</strong></button></div><div class="stage-caption"><p id="stageDescription">Start with what the artifact already knows. Metadata and statistics can rule out work before row reads.</p><span class="mono">Conceptual route / not a benchmark</span></div></div>
 </div>
</section>
<section class="section paper vortex section-anchor" id="vortex" aria-labelledby="vortex-title">
 <div class="ghost-word" aria-hidden="true">VORTEX</div>
 <div class="wrap"><div class="vortex-heading"><p class="eyebrow">02 / The native middle</p><h2 id="vortex-title">Not at the edge.<br><span class="soft">At the center.</span></h2><p class="copy">Vortex isn't another format on a list. It is the native middle ShardLoom is built around.</p></div><div class="vortex-composition"><p class="vortex-note">Many input boundaries.<br>One encoded middle.<br>Explicit outputs.</p><div class="vortex-specs"><div><span class="spec-icon">⤷</span><section><strong>Source adapters</strong><small>Formats enter at the boundary.</small></section></div><div><span class="spec-icon">◇</span><section><strong>Prepared state</strong><small>Structure that can be reused.</small></section></div><div><span class="spec-icon">▥</span><section><strong>Encoded layouts</strong><small>Keep native structure in play.</small></section></div><div><span class="spec-icon">↗</span><section><strong>Explicit outputs</strong><small>Materialize where required.</small></section></div></div></div></div>
 <div class="vortex-art scene" data-scene="plates" aria-hidden="true"><svg class="fallback" viewBox="0 0 700 700"><g fill="#21425d" fill-opacity=".12" stroke="#517790" stroke-width="1"><path d="m350 155 190 105-190 110-190-110Zm0 60 190 105-190 110-190-110Zm0 60 190 105-190 110-190-110Zm0 60 190 105-190 110-190-110Z"/></g></svg><canvas></canvas><span class="art-caption">.vortex / exploded architectural view</span></div>
</section>
<section class="section loom-section section-anchor" id="capillary" aria-labelledby="loom-title">
 <div class="loom-art scene" data-scene="loom" aria-hidden="true"><canvas></canvas><span class="art-caption">Capillary<br>work units</span><span class="art-caption lower">Source / decode / sink<br>Visible boundaries.</span></div>
 <div class="wrap"><div class="loom-content"><p class="eyebrow">03 / Capillary work</p><h2 id="loom-title">Work isn't<br><span class="soft">a box.</span></h2><p class="copy">Break opaque tasks into small, typed units. Keep their boundaries visible as work is split, combined, reused, or retried.</p><a class="text-link" href="#pulseweave">Follow the work <span class="arrow">↓</span></a></div></div>
 <div class="loom-bottom"><div><span class="mono">SOURCE RANGE</span><p>Where the work begins.</p></div><div><span class="mono">PROJECTION / FILTER</span><p>What the route actually needs.</p></div><div><span class="mono">PRESSURE / RETRY</span><p>The constraints it carries.</p></div><div><span class="mono">MATERIALIZATION</span><p>Where representation changes.</p></div></div>
</section>
<section class="section pulse-section section-anchor" id="pulseweave" aria-labelledby="pulse-title">
 <div class="wrap"><div class="pulse-layout"><div class="pulse-heading"><p class="eyebrow">04 / PulseWeave</p><h2 id="pulse-title">Compute<br>should <span class="soft">feel<br>pressure.</span></h2><p class="copy">Visible work. Visible scarcity. Run-local feedback—with adaptation bounded by route evidence.</p></div><div class="pulse-right"><div class="pulse-topline"><span>Pressure study</span><b id="pressureReadout">01 / Steady flow</b></div><div class="pulse-art scene" data-scene="pulse" aria-hidden="true"><canvas></canvas></div><div class="mode-tabs" aria-label="Conceptual pressure conditions"><button class="mode-tab" type="button" data-mode="steady" aria-label="Show steady flow pressure condition" aria-pressed="true">Steady flow</button><button class="mode-tab" type="button" data-mode="memory" aria-label="Show memory pressure condition" aria-pressed="false">Memory pressure</button><button class="mode-tab" type="button" data-mode="sink" aria-label="Show sink pressure condition" aria-pressed="false">Sink pressure</button></div><p class="mode-description" id="modeDescription" aria-live="polite">Work units travel through a bounded route. The model keeps source, execution, and output work visible.</p></div></div><div class="pulse-vocabulary"><div><strong>FlowInventory</strong><p>What work is in flight.</p></div><div><strong>ScarcityLedger</strong><p>Which pressures are present.</p></div><div><strong>EndoPulse</strong><p>Where run-local feedback enters.</p></div><div><strong>ProofBound</strong><p>What the route permits to adapt.</p></div></div><p class="model-disclosure">Interactive architecture illustration. Not live telemetry or measured scheduler behavior.</p></div>
</section>
<section class="section paper manifesto" aria-labelledby="manifesto-title"><div class="wrap manifesto-layout"><div><p class="eyebrow">05 / Materialization</p><h2 id="manifesto-title">DON'T DECODE.<span>DON'T COPY.</span><span>DON'T MATERIALIZE.</span>UNTIL YOU HAVE TO.</h2></div><div class="manifesto-aside"><p class="copy">Keep computation close to the representation that already exists. Use encoded paths where admitted. Decode and materialize at explicit boundaries.</p><div class="representation"><span>Metadata</span><span>Encoded representation</span><span>Decode if required</span><span class="last">→ Output boundary</span></div></div></div></section>
<section class="section artifact-section section-anchor" id="artifact" aria-labelledby="artifact-title">
 <div class="wrap"><div class="artifact-layout"><div class="artifact-heading"><p class="eyebrow">06 / Embedded intelligence</p><h2 id="artifact-title">The file<br><span class="soft">knows more.</span></h2><p class="copy">Preparation can keep reusable intelligence inside the same <span class="accent">.vortex</span> artifact, instead of rebuilding it beside every query.</p><p class="artifact-foot">One artifact.<br>More to work with.</p></div><div class="artifact-display"><div class="artifact-art scene" data-scene="artifact" aria-hidden="true"><canvas></canvas><span class="art-caption">Single artifact / internal structure</span></div><div class="artifact-layers" aria-label="Inspect artifact layers"><button type="button" class="layer-btn" data-layer="0" aria-label="Inspect data layer" aria-pressed="true">Data</button><button type="button" class="layer-btn" data-layer="1" aria-label="Inspect layout layer" aria-pressed="false">Layout</button><button type="button" class="layer-btn" data-layer="2" aria-label="Inspect statistics layer" aria-pressed="false">Statistics</button><button type="button" class="layer-btn" data-layer="3" aria-label="Inspect segment map layer" aria-pressed="false">Segment map</button><button type="button" class="layer-btn" data-layer="4" aria-label="Inspect dictionaries layer" aria-pressed="false">Dictionaries</button><button type="button" class="layer-btn" data-layer="5" aria-label="Inspect domain intel layer" aria-pressed="false">Domain intel</button><button type="button" class="layer-btn" data-layer="6" aria-label="Inspect row locality layer" aria-pressed="false">Row locality</button></div><div class="layer-detail" aria-live="polite"><strong id="layerName">01 / DATA</strong><p id="layerDescription">The prepared columnar payload remains the center of the artifact—not a query sidecar.</p></div></div></div></div>
</section>
<section class="contract-section" aria-labelledby="contract-title"><div class="wrap contract-layout"><div class="contract-heading"><p class="eyebrow">07 / An explicit contract</p><h2 id="contract-title">No secret<br><span class="soft">plan B.</span></h2><p class="copy">Unsupported work returns a diagnostic. It doesn't quietly become somebody else's compute engine.</p></div><RouteEvidence /></div></section>
<section class="section paper code-section section-anchor" id="code" aria-labelledby="code-title"><div class="wrap"><div class="code-header"><div><p class="eyebrow">08 / The human side</p><h2 id="code-title">A familiar front door.<br><span class="soft">A different kind of engine.</span></h2></div><p class="copy">Explore the native middle without learning a new way to start.</p></div><div class="code-layout"><div class="code-tabs" role="tablist" aria-label="Code examples"><button id="tab-python" class="code-tab" role="tab" aria-label="Show Python example" aria-selected="true" aria-controls="code-panel" data-code="python" tabindex="0"><span class="arrow">↗</span>Python</button><button id="tab-sql" class="code-tab" role="tab" aria-label="Show SQL example" aria-selected="false" aria-controls="code-panel" data-code="sql" tabindex="-1"><span class="arrow">↗</span>SQL</button><button id="tab-install" class="code-tab" role="tab" aria-label="Show install example" aria-selected="false" aria-controls="code-panel" data-code="install" tabindex="-1"><span class="arrow">↗</span>Install</button></div><div><div class="editor" id="code-panel" role="tabpanel" aria-labelledby="tab-python"><div class="editor-top"><div class="editor-top-left"><span class="editor-dots" aria-hidden="true"><i></i><i></i><i></i></span><span class="editor-title" id="editorTitle">quickstart.py</span></div><button class="copy-btn" type="button" id="copyCode" aria-label="Copy current code example"><svg viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="5" y="5" width="9" height="9" rx="1"/><path d="M10 3V1H1v9h2"/></svg><span>Copy</span></button></div><pre class="code-body"><code id="codeBlock">import shardloom as sl

ctx = sl.context()
result = (
    ctx.read("orders.csv")
       .filter(sl.col("status") == "paid")
       .limit(10)
       .collect()
)

print(result.output_row_count)</code></pre></div><p class="example-note" id="exampleNote">Example from the public README. Bring a local orders.csv with a status column. Supported operations and enabled features still apply.</p><p class="code-status" id="copyStatus" role="status"></p></div></div><div class="code-footer"><p class="small">Scoped local workflows · No broad SQL / DataFrame parity implied.</p><a class="text-link" href="https://github.com/depsilon/shardloom/blob/main/docs/getting-started/first-10-minutes.md" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Read the getting-started guide <span class="arrow">↗</span></a></div></div></section>
<section class="architecture section-anchor" id="architecture" aria-labelledby="architecture-title"><div class="wrap"><div class="architecture-head"><div><p class="eyebrow">09 / From end to end</p><h2 id="architecture-title">One engine. Explicit boundaries.</h2></div><p class="small">The visual story, expressed as an execution route.</p></div><div class="flow-poster"><div class="route-node"><strong>Source state</strong><span>Admitted local input</span></div><span class="arrow" aria-hidden="true">→</span><div class="route-node core"><strong>Vortex prepared</strong><span>The native middle</span></div><span class="arrow" aria-hidden="true">→</span><div class="route-node core"><strong>Native execution</strong><span>Bounded work / PulseWeave</span></div><span class="arrow" aria-hidden="true">→</span><div class="route-node"><strong>Output plan</strong><span>Sink or collect</span></div><span class="arrow" aria-hidden="true">→</span><div class="route-node"><strong>Evidence</strong><span>What actually ran</span></div></div><TimingBoundaries /><p class="architecture-footer">Know before reading &nbsp; / &nbsp; Preserve the encoded middle &nbsp; / &nbsp; Make work explicit &nbsp; / &nbsp; Inspect the outcome</p></div></section>
<section class="finale section-anchor" id="horizon" aria-labelledby="horizon-title"><div class="horizon-art scene" data-scene="horizon" aria-hidden="true"><canvas></canvas></div><div class="wrap finale-content"><p class="eyebrow">The ambition</p><h2 id="horizon-title">UNIVERSAL<span>COMPUTE.</span></h2><p class="copy">A universal-compute ambition.<br>A local Vortex-native starting point.</p><button class="install-button" type="button" id="copyInstall" aria-label="Copy Python install command"><span>python -m pip install shardloom</span><svg viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="5" y="5" width="9" height="9" rx="1"/><path d="M10 3V1H1v9h2"/></svg></button><p class="install-status" id="installStatus" role="status"></p></div><span class="finale-tag">Make less work.<br>Make room for more.</span><span class="finale-tag right">Open source.<br>Native by design.</span></section>
</main>
